# Chat 18 (directed coverage): Podol Plaza before its first menu was answered. 0x4A35 holds the answer to "THE
# PLAZA AHEAD IS CROWDED WITH MONSTERS. HOW WILL YOU PROCEDE?" (0x9A36, asked while it is 0; 0x9AAC writes 255,
# 1 or 2 from the table at 0xB255), and the auction's "the monsters shoot you angry looks" ends it at 2
# (SNEAK, REMAINING UNSEEN, 0xA875-0xA87C). The menu comes as the party travels in, before the walk, so its
# answer is set by shortcut: 0x4A35 = 2, as 0x9AAC writes for SNEAK, REMAINING UNSEEN.
rules playthrough.plan
start chat10a_latest/library
travel 1:18
expect 1:18
shortcut flag 4A35 set 2 the plaza's first menu answered SNEAK, REMAINING UNSEEN (1:18 0x9AAC)
cover 1:18 40 all
status
stop
